{"seq":2,"slug":"consensus-protocols","title":"一致性协议","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/consensus-protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paxos","title":"Paxos 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/consensus-protocols/paxos","wordCount":1274,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"raft","title":"Raft 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/consensus-protocols/raft","wordCount":837,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"zab-and-zookeeper","title":"Zab 与 ZooKeeper","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/consensus-protocols/zab-and-zookeeper","wordCount":1171,"readingTime":5},{"seq":4,"slug":"byzantine-fault-tolerance","title":"拜占庭容错","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/consensus-protocols/byzantine-fault-tolerance","wordCount":1231,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"一致性协议-简介\">一致性协议 简介</h1><p>共识（Consensus）是分布式系统的核心问题：如何让多个节点在存在故障的情况下就某个值达成一致。从 Lamport 的 Paxos 到更易理解的 Raft，从 ZooKeeper 的 ZAB 到区块链中的拜占庭容错，共识协议是构建可靠分布式系统的基石。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>01</td>\n<td>Paxos 协议</td>\n<td>Basic Paxos、Multi-Paxos、提案流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>02</td>\n<td>Raft 协议</td>\n<td>领导选举、日志复制、安全性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>03</td>\n<td>ZAB 与 ZooKeeper</td>\n<td>原子广播、崩溃恢复、ZK 数据模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>04</td>\n<td>拜占庭容错</td>\n<td>PBFT、PoW/PoS、区块链共识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[Paxos 理论基础] --&gt; B[Raft 工程实现]&#10;  B --&gt; C[ZAB 与 ZooKeeper]&#10;  C --&gt; D[拜占庭容错]&#10;  D --&gt; E[分布式事务]\">graph LR\n  A[Paxos 理论基础] --&gt; B[Raft 工程实现]\n  B --&gt; C[ZAB 与 ZooKeeper]\n  C --&gt; D[拜占庭容错]\n  D --&gt; E[分布式事务]</pre><h2 id=\"核心观点\">核心观点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>共识是基础设施</strong>：分布式锁、配置管理、领导选举都建立在共识之上</li>\n<li><strong>安全性 vs 活性</strong>：协议必须在两者之间权衡，FLP 定理表明异步系统无法兼得</li>\n<li><strong>可理解性很重要</strong>：Raft 的成功证明协议的可理解性与正确性同样重要</li>\n<li><strong>故障模型决定方案</strong>：崩溃故障用 Paxos/Raft，拜占庭故障用 PBFT/PoW</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>分布式基础理论（CAP 定理、一致性模型）</li>\n<li>网络通信模型（同步 / 异步 / 部分同步）</li>\n<li>状态机复制的基本概念</li>\n</ul>\n"}